# cgm: the reference gives the first contact of a contact group twice.
mask sm3 cgm the reference names the first member of a contact group twice
# sgrp: the states of the services of a group. The reference has the
# services in the reverse of the order it added them in, checkd by name.
mask sm3 sgrp the order of the members of a service group

# At second 63 the check of host a ends in the same millisecond as this
# check of a service on it starts. The reference started the service check
# first, so it still shows the host's check before.
mask sm4@63019 lhc,lhu the host's result and the start of this check fall in the same millisecond
